# What a Mac's (or Linux's) Brewfile becomes on Windows (lib/core/crossos.sh).
# kind|brew name|winget id|scoop name
#   A formula not listed here is tried with scoop under the same name, when scoop is here.
#   A cask needs a line: its winget id, or else its scoop name (from the extras bucket).
#   "-" in a column: nothing to install there (Git Bash has it, or it is a library).
#   "@tool": that dudu collector installs it (node, cargo, bun).
#   Empty: no package there.
